{"book":"patterns","bookTitle":"Number patterns and sequences","concept":2,"title":"Continuing number patterns","grades":"Grade 5","goal":"I can find the rule of a number pattern and continue it.","teach":"A number pattern, or <b>sequence</b>, follows a rule. Find the <b>difference</b> between each term and the next. If the difference is the same every time, the rule is “add” (or “subtract”) that number. This is the <b>term-to-term rule</b>.","tvis":"<div class=\"vis\"><span class=\"vi\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:676px;height:auto\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 98\"><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"490\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><line x1=\"40.0\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"40.0\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"40.0\" y=\"86.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">4</text><line x1=\"150.0\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"150.0\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"150.0\" y=\"86.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">9</text><line x1=\"260.0\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"260.0\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"260.0\" y=\"86.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">14</text><line x1=\"370.0\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"370.0\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"370.0\" y=\"86.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">19</text><line x1=\"480.0\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"480.0\" y2=\"69\" stroke=\"#555555\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"480.0\" y=\"86.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#444444\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"normal\">24</text><path d=\"M40.0,59 Q95.0,7.0 150.0,59\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M143.0,52 L150.0,59 L148.9,50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"95.0\" y=\"27.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#7A0000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">+5</text><path d=\"M150.0,59 Q205.0,7.0 260.0,59\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M253.0,52 L260.0,59 L258.9,50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"205.0\" y=\"27.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#7A0000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">+5</text><path d=\"M260.0,59 Q315.0,7.0 370.0,59\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M363.0,52 L370.0,59 L368.9,50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"315.0\" y=\"27.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#7A0000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">+5</text><path d=\"M370.0,59 Q425.0,7.0 480.0,59\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M473.0,52 L480.0,59 L478.9,50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7A0000\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"425.0\" y=\"27.0\" font-family=\"Public Sans\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#7A0000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">+5</text></svg></span></div>","ex":{"q":"Write the next two terms: 85; 78; 71; 64; …","steps":["Find the differences: 78 − 85 = −7, 71 − 78 = −7, 64 − 71 = −7.","The rule is “subtract 7”.","64 − 7 = 57 and 57 − 7 = 50."]},"watch":"Check the difference between every pair of terms, not only the first two.","qs":[{"text":"Write the next two terms: 103; 97; 91; 85","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"Next","a":"79","form":"val","o":null},{"t":"box","label":"Then","a":"73","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"Subtract 6.","steps":"1. Rule (constant difference): find the difference between terms (next term − term), then add it each time.<br>2. 97 − 103 = −6, so subtract 6.<br>3. 85 − 6 = 79<br>4. 79 − 6 = 73"},{"text":"Fill in the missing terms: 6; ___; 20; 27; ___","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"First gap","a":"13","form":"val","o":null},{"t":"box","label":"Last gap","a":"34","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"Add 7.","steps":"1. Rule (constant difference): find the difference between terms (next term − term), then add it each time.<br>2. 27 − 20 = 7, so add 7.<br>3. 6 + 7 = 13<br>4. 27 + 7 = 34"},{"text":"Start at 150 and subtract 25 each time. What is the 5th term?","vis":"","parts":[{"t":"box","label":"5th term","a":"50","form":"val","o":null}],"hint":"Subtract 25 four times.","steps":"1. Rule (constant difference): find the difference between terms (next term − term), then add it each time.<br>2. 150; 125; 100; 75; 50<br>3. The 5th term is 50."}]}